flowchart TB
  subgraph W[Windows 用户会话 · 标准用户权限]
    APP[HerdDesk.App · WinUI]
    CORE[HerdDesk.Core · DeviceSession actor / Store / Policies]
    VT[ITerminalRenderer · WebView2+xterm 默认 / Native 候选]
    RPC[RpcStdioTransport · 请求连接与订阅连接分离]
    TS[TerminalCliTransport · 长期 stdio 子进程]
    B[自有 herddesk-bridge · 只转发 RPC 字节]
    EXE[本地 herdr.exe terminal session]
    SSH[ssh.exe -T]
    APP --> CORE
    APP --> VT
    CORE --> RPC
    CORE --> TS
    RPC --> B
    TS --> EXE
    RPC --> SSH
    TS --> SSH
    TS -->|frame bytes| VT
    VT -->|用户输入与尺寸事件| CORE
  end
  B -->|NDJSON / Windows named pipe| LD[本地 herdr daemon · 拥有 ConPTY/agent]
  EXE -->|上游内部 client protocol| LD
  SSH --> RB[远端自有 bridge · stdio ↔ Unix API socket]
  SSH --> RT[远端 herdr terminal session]
  RB --> RD[Linux/macOS herdr daemon · 拥有 PTY/agent]
  RT --> RD
